update public.services set body = '<p>When a defendant misses court, the clock on the bond starts running. We locate skips quickly and work with your agency until the defendant is back in custody, so you can protect the bond and your business.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Skip tracing from the bond paperwork you already have: references, co-signers, employers and last known addresses</li><li>Database, public record and social media searches to build a current picture of where the defendant is living and working</li><li>Field work and surveillance to confirm a location before anyone moves</li><li>Regular status updates until the defendant is located or recovered</li><li>Coordination with your agency and law enforcement, within Texas law</li></ul><p>Submit a skip online or call us any time. Tell us the defendant&#x27;s name, bond amount, county and court date, and we&#x27;ll call you back to confirm next steps.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Skip tracing and fugitive recovery for bail bond companies in Dallas–Fort Worth. Licensed Texas investigators who locate defendants fast so you don''t forfeit the bond.' where slug = 'fugitive-recovery-skip-tracing';
update public.services set body = '<p>Suspecting a partner of cheating is exhausting, and guessing makes it worse. We find out what is really happening, quietly, and give you facts you can act on, whether that means peace of mind or preparing for divorce.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Surveillance with time-stamped photo and video</li><li>Background checks on a suspected partner</li><li>Activity checks around specific dates, trips or patterns you&#x27;ve noticed</li><li>Asset searches when divorce is on the table</li><li>A written report your attorney can use</li></ul><p>Everything you tell us stays confidential, and we contact you only the way you say is safe.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Discreet infidelity and divorce investigations in Dallas, TX. Licensed private investigators who document the facts with photos, video and a written report.' where slug = 'infidelity';
update public.services set body = '<p>When a child&#x27;s safety or a custody order is at stake, the court needs facts, not accusations. We document what is actually happening so you and your attorney can present it properly.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Surveillance during visitation and custody exchanges</li><li>Documentation of living conditions, supervision and who is around the child</li><li>Checks on compliance with existing custody orders</li><li>Income and asset research for child support disputes</li><li>Court-ready reports, and testimony when needed</li></ul><p>We work carefully and within Texas law, so the evidence holds up.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Child custody and child support investigations in Dallas, TX. Licensed investigators document a child''s living conditions and a parent''s conduct for family court.' where slug = 'child-custody';
update public.services set body = '<p>Family law cases turn on details. We work with you and your attorney to gather the evidence a family court needs, handled with discretion because these cases are personal.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Surveillance and activity checks</li><li>Locating a spouse, parent or witness</li><li>Hidden income and asset research</li><li>Background checks on a new partner or household member</li><li>Clear written reports for your attorney</li></ul><p>Tell us what&#x27;s going on in a free, confidential consultation and we&#x27;ll explain what we can find and what it will cost.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Family law investigations in Dallas, TX: evidence, locates and background research for divorce, custody and support cases.' where slug = 'family-law';
update public.services set body = '<p>Surveillance is often the only way to see what someone is really doing. Our investigators blend in, follow the law, and record what happens so the facts speak for themselves.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Infidelity and relationship cases</li><li>Custody and visitation</li><li>Workers&#x27; compensation and insurance claims</li><li>Employee misconduct</li><li>Activity checks for attorneys</li></ul><p>You get time-stamped photos and video and a written report of what we observed, ready for court if needed.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Professional surveillance in Dallas–Fort Worth. Experienced investigators document activity with time-stamped photo and video for personal, legal and business cases.' where slug = 'surveillance';
update public.services set body = '<p>Video is the most persuasive evidence there is, if it&#x27;s gathered properly. We capture clear, time-stamped footage from lawful vantage points and document the chain of custody.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Mobile and stationary video surveillance</li><li>Documentation for insurance, injury and workers&#x27; compensation claims</li><li>Evidence for custody, divorce and civil cases</li><li>Footage organized and logged for your attorney</li></ul><p>Not sure surveillance is the right step? A free consultation will tell you.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Covert video surveillance in Dallas, TX. Time-stamped footage and written reports that stand up in court.' where slug = 'video-surveillance';
update public.services set body = '<p>If someone always seems to know where you&#x27;ve been or what you&#x27;ve said, you may be tracked. We search your vehicle, home or office for hidden devices and tell you what we find.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Vehicle checks for GPS trackers</li><li>Home and office sweeps for hidden cameras and listening devices</li><li>Phone and computer checks for spyware, with our forensics team</li><li>Advice on what to do if a device is found</li></ul><p>Call from a phone you trust, and we&#x27;ll arrange a discreet appointment.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Electronic surveillance detection and bug sweeps in Dallas, TX. Find hidden GPS trackers, cameras and listening devices in your car, home or office.' where slug = 'electronic-surveillance';
update public.services set body = '<p>Online background reports are often incomplete or wrong. We verify the details that matter, using public records, courthouse searches and investigative databases, so you can make decisions with confidence.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Identity and address history verification</li><li>Criminal and civil court record searches</li><li>Employment and education checks</li><li>Checks on business partners, tenants, caregivers and new relationships</li><li>People locates for attorneys, families and businesses</li></ul><p>Searches follow federal and Texas privacy law, including the FCRA where it applies.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Detailed background checks in Dallas, TX by licensed private investigators: identity, criminal, civil, address and employment history.' where slug = 'background-checks';
update public.services set body = '<p>For high-stakes decisions, a standard check isn&#x27;t enough. A deep background investigation looks past the database to verify a person&#x27;s history, reputation and connections.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Records from multiple counties and states</li><li>Corporate filings, liens, judgments and litigation history</li><li>Discreet reference and source interviews</li><li>Online presence and social media review</li><li>A written report that separates verified facts from unconfirmed leads</li></ul><p>Commonly used before partnerships, investments, executive hires and high-net-worth relationships.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Deep background investigations in Dallas, TX that go beyond database reports: records, interviews and history verification.' where slug = 'deep-background';
update public.services set body = '<p>A bad hire is expensive. We screen candidates so you know who you&#x27;re bringing into your business, with screening that respects the candidate&#x27;s rights.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Identity, address and employment history verification</li><li>Criminal record searches</li><li>Education and license verification</li><li>Reference checks</li><li>Social media review where lawful and relevant to the role</li></ul><p>We&#x27;ll help you set up screening that fits your hiring process and the law.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Pre-employment screening in Dallas, TX. Background and reference checks that help you hire with confidence and stay compliant.' where slug = 'pre-employment-screening';
update public.services set body = '<p>Identity theft can damage your credit, finances and reputation for years. We help you find out how it happened and who is behind it, and build the evidence police and creditors need.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Review of fraudulent accounts, applications and activity</li><li>Tracing the people and addresses connected to the fraud</li><li>Evidence packages for police reports and creditor disputes</li><li>Steps to protect your identity going forward</li></ul><p>The sooner you act, the easier it is to contain. Call us for a free consultation.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Identity theft investigations in Dallas, TX. Find out who is using your identity, gather evidence, and work with police and creditors to stop it.' where slug = 'identity-theft';
update public.services set body = '<p>Assets are easy to hide and hard to find without the right records. We trace property, businesses and financial connections so you and your attorney know what is really there.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Real estate, vehicle and business ownership searches</li><li>Hidden assets in divorce cases</li><li>Judgment collection and debtor research</li><li>Liens, judgments, bankruptcies and UCC filings</li><li>Financial background for investments and partnerships</li></ul><p>All research uses lawful sources, and findings come in a clear written report.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Asset and financial investigations in Dallas, TX. Find hidden assets for divorce, judgment collection and litigation.' where slug = 'asset-financial';
update public.services set body = '<p>Phones and computers hold the evidence in most modern cases, including messages that were deleted. Our forensics work recovers and preserves that data in a way that holds up in court.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Recovery of deleted texts, photos, call logs and files</li><li>Spyware and stalkerware checks</li><li>Evidence of harassment, threats and online deception</li><li>Forensic copies that preserve the original device</li><li>Reports and testimony for attorneys</li></ul><p>We only examine devices you own or have legal authority to search. Ask us if you&#x27;re not sure.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Computer and mobile phone forensics in Dallas, TX. Recover deleted texts, photos and files, and preserve digital evidence for court.' where slug = 'computer-mobile-forensics';
update public.services set body = '<p>Internal problems cost money and trust. We investigate quietly and objectively so you can act on facts and protect your business.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Employee theft and fraud</li><li>Workplace misconduct and policy violations</li><li>Workers&#x27; compensation and insurance fraud</li><li>Intellectual property and trade secret leaks</li><li>Undercover and surveillance work</li></ul><p>Findings come in a written report your HR team and counsel can rely on.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Employment and corporate investigations in Dallas, TX: employee theft, fraud, misconduct and internal investigations.' where slug = 'corporate';
update public.services set body = '<p>Before you sign, know who you&#x27;re dealing with. We check the people and companies behind a deal for the risks that don&#x27;t show up in a pitch deck.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Background on owners, executives and key partners</li><li>Litigation, judgments, liens and bankruptcy history</li><li>Corporate records and related companies</li><li>Reputation and media review</li><li>Asset and ownership verification</li></ul><p>Tell us about the deal and the timeline, and we&#x27;ll scope the work to fit.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Due diligence investigations in Dallas, TX. Vet business partners, investments and acquisitions before you commit.' where slug = 'due-diligence';
update public.services set body = '<p>Most security gaps are obvious once someone looks. We review your property, routines and exposure and give you clear, practical fixes.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Home and office physical security reviews</li><li>Camera, lighting, lock and access-control checks</li><li>Online exposure of you, your family or your executives</li><li>Electronic sweeps for hidden devices</li><li>A prioritized list of improvements</li></ul><p>Useful after a break-in, a threat, a public profile change or a move.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Security assessments in Dallas, TX for homes and businesses. Find the weak points before someone else does.' where slug = 'security-assessments';
update public.services set body = '<p>Good protection is quiet. We plan around your schedule and routines so you can go about your day with less risk and less disruption.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Protection for travel, events and daily routines</li><li>Advance work and route planning</li><li>Threat and risk assessments</li><li>Security for high-profile individuals and their families</li></ul><p>Protection is arranged under Texas licensing rules. Call to talk about your needs confidentially.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Executive protection in Dallas, TX for executives, public figures and families who need discreet, professional security.' where slug = 'executive-protection';
update public.services set body = '<p>A case can stall when a key witness or party can&#x27;t be found. We locate people quickly using records, databases and field work.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Witness locates for civil and criminal cases</li><li>Defendant and debtor locates</li><li>Address verification before service of process</li><li>Locating heirs, beneficiaries and old contacts</li><li>Witness interviews and statements</li></ul><p>Send us what you have, even if it&#x27;s only a name and an old address.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Witness and defendant location in Dallas, TX. Licensed investigators find people so your case can move forward.' where slug = 'witness-defendant-location';
update public.services set body = '<p>Civil cases are won on evidence. We gather the facts, find the witnesses and document what happened in a form your attorney can use.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Witness location and interviews</li><li>Surveillance and activity checks</li><li>Background and asset research on parties</li><li>Personal injury, premises liability and insurance cases</li><li>Court-ready reports and testimony</li></ul><p>We work directly with law firms and with individuals who are represented.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Civil investigations in Dallas, TX for attorneys and clients: evidence, witnesses and research for civil litigation.' where slug = 'civil-investigations';
update public.services set body = '<p>The prosecution has investigators; the defense should too. We work for your attorney to test the evidence and find what was missed.</p><h2>How we help</h2><ul><li>Witness location and interviews</li><li>Scene review and photography</li><li>Background research on witnesses</li><li>Phone and computer forensics</li><li>Timeline and alibi verification</li></ul><p>We work at the direction of your defense attorney, which helps keep our work protected.</p><h2>Free, confidential consultation</h2><p>Bring ''Em In Investigations is a licensed Texas private investigation agency serving Dallas, Fort Worth and North Texas. Call us or send a confidential message, and we''ll tell you honestly what we can do and what it will cost before any work starts.</p>', seo_description = 'Criminal defense investigations in Dallas, TX. Independent investigation to support your defense attorney.' where slug = 'criminal-investigations';
